<http://purl.org/vocab/bio/0.1/date> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "<p>The date should be formatted as specified in <a href=\"http://www.w3.org/TR/NOTE-datetime\">ISO8601</a>.\n    For example: 2003-03-15 corresponds to the 15th March 2003, and 2003-03-15T13:21-05:00 corresponds to 15th March 2003, 8:21 am, US Eastern Standard Time.</p>"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#XMLLiteral> .
