<http://purl.org/vocab/bio/0.1/Event> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An event is an occurrence that brings about a change in the state of affairs for one or more people and/or other agents. Events are assumed to occur over a period of time and may not have precise start and end points."@en .
<http://purl.org/vocab/bio/0.1/Event> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "testing" .
