<http://purl.org/vocab/bio/0.1/Event> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "This class is intended to describe biographical events, i.e. events in the life of a person."@en .
<http://purl.org/vocab/bio/0.1/initiatingEvent> <http://purl.org/net/vocab/2004/03/label#plural> "Initiating Event"@en .
